- Fluxbox window manager
- cw — custom package manager
- GTK compilation framework started
- Default credentials: root / root (change immediately)
- x86_64, Intel HD Graphics support (kernel can be recompiled for other hardware)
- Deployment: copy rootfs to drive, install GRUB
- Note: some test files remain, can be deleted

